{
  "schema": "dislop.bench-detection/1",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "license": "CC0-1.0",
  "description": "16 real-world adversarial holdout samples (8 hard positives + 8 hard negatives) added in Round 4 to prevent overfitting to detection-v1.json.",
  "samples": [
    {
      "id": "ho-01-zh-chat-closer",
      "domain": "zh-brief",
      "pack": "business-brief",
      "modality": "markdown",
      "filename": "rollout.md",
      "expected": "slop",
      "category": "artifact",
      "expectedRuleIds": ["chatbot-artifact"],
      "text": "周二 10:00 切流，预计耗时 15 分钟。希望这对你有帮助！"
    },
    {
      "id": "ho-02-zh-pivot-juefei",
      "domain": "zh-brief",
      "pack": "business-brief",
      "modality": "markdown",
      "filename": "arch.md",
      "expected": "slop",
      "category": "second-order",
      "expectedRuleIds": ["negation-pivot-frame"],
      "text": "这绝非简单的参数调优，而是底层架构的彻底重塑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ho-03-zh-moral-guigen",
      "domain": "zh-essay",
      "pack": "literary-essay",
      "modality": "markdown",
      "filename": "rain.md",
      "expected": "slop",
      "category": "slop",
      "expectedRuleIds": ["zh-essay-moralizing-ending"],
      "text": "窗外的雨停了。归根结底，效率从来不是工具赋予的，而是团队共同的选择。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ho-04-en-chat-happy",
      "domain": "en-brief",
      "pack": "business-brief",
      "modality": "markdown",
      "filename": "rfc.md",
      "expected": "slop",
      "category": "artifact",
      "expectedRuleIds": ["chatbot-artifact"],
      "text": "Happy to help! Below is the updated RFC for cache invalidation."
    },
    {
      "id": "ho-05-en-pivot-merely",
      "domain": "en-brief",
      "pack": "business-brief",
      "modality": "markdown",
      "filename": "search.md",
      "expected": "slop",
      "category": "second-order",
      "expectedRuleIds": ["negation-pivot-frame"],
      "text": "It is not merely a redesign, but a complete reimagining of search."
    },
    {
      "id": "ho-06-en-landscape",
      "domain": "en-brief",
      "pack": "business-brief",
      "modality": "markdown",
      "filename": "intro.md",
      "expected": "slop",
      "category": "slop",
      "expectedRuleIds": ["en-throat-clearing-opener"],
      "text": "In today's fast-paced digital landscape, teams need clear metrics."
    },
    {
      "id": "ho-07-html-jsvoid",
      "domain": "html-ui",
      "pack": "deck-and-ui",
      "modality": "html",
      "filename": "sdk.html",
      "expected": "slop",
      "category": "artifact",
      "expectedRuleIds": ["ui-dead-control"],
      "text": "<a href=\"javascript:void(0)\">Download SDK</a>"
    },
    {
      "id": "ho-08-zh-ascii-placeholder",
      "domain": "zh-brief",
      "pack": "business-brief",
      "modality": "markdown",
      "filename": "canary.md",
      "expected": "slop",
      "category": "artifact",
      "expectedRuleIds": ["unfilled-placeholder"],
      "text": "本次灰度覆盖 [待填写] 个集群，下周三全量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ho-09-fenced-code-clean",
      "domain": "zh-brief",
      "pack": "business-brief",
      "modality": "markdown",
      "filename": "example.md",
      "expected": "clean",
      "category": "near-miss",
      "expectedRuleIds": [],
      "text": "示例输入如下：\n```text\nCertainly! Here is your draft. 全面赋能抓手。\n```\n实测耗时 12ms。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ho-10-en-numeric-pivot-clean",
      "domain": "en-brief",
      "pack": "business-brief",
      "modality": "markdown",
      "filename": "postmortem.md",
      "expected": "clean",
      "category": "near-miss",
      "expectedRuleIds": [],
      "text": "The timeout wasn't 30s — it was 300s because of the proxy default."
    },
    {
      "id": "ho-11-zh-factual-pivot-clean",
      "domain": "zh-brief",
      "pack": "business-brief",
      "modality": "markdown",
      "filename": "incident.md",
      "expected": "clean",
      "category": "near-miss",
      "expectedRuleIds": [],
      "text": "报错原因不是磁盘满，而是 inode 耗尽导致无法创建临时文件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ho-12-en-go-debugger-clean",
      "domain": "en-brief",
      "pack": "business-brief",
      "modality": "markdown",
      "filename": "debug.md",
      "expected": "clean",
      "category": "clean",
      "expectedRuleIds": [],
